Subject: [PATCH 392/443] [ae-patch] Keep the iOS mic take alive while the user
 talks: interim results on WebKit, idle recycle stops instead of aborting, and
 the voice log records speech synthesis and old recognizer ends

On iOS WebKit with interim results off, the recognizer never sends soundstart or speechstart, so the 10 s idle recycle saw a silent take and aborted it mid-utterance. WebKit now asks for interim results (only finals reach the draft; interims count as activity), the recycle uses stop so a late final is delivered, and the log gains speechSynthesis state and detached recognizer end and error events.
